        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The difference was not statistically significant (OR 1.73; 95% CI 0.57–5.27; p=.34) in the 52-treated/49-control ABC follow-up. This is a secondary education outcome, not a separate trial or evidence of a degree effect.",
